msgstr "已手动停止"

msgid "Succeeded"
msgstr "成功"

msgid "Success"
msgstr "成功"

msgid "Turn this setting off periodically to check for updates, or manage updates from \"WP Overview\" in WP Panel. Re-enable the site file lock when maintenance is complete."
msgstr "定期临时关闭此开关检查更新，或通过 WP Panel 的“WP 总览”管理更新；完成后再开启网站文件锁定。"

msgid "Temporary unlock"
msgstr "临时解锁"

msgid "The API key is the dedicated credential this plugin uses to connect to WP Panel; it is generated and stored by the panel automatically. Only the first 8 characters are shown here; the full key cannot be viewed or changed."
msgstr "API Key 是插件连接 WP Panel 的专用凭据，由面板自动生成和保管。本页只显示前 8 位，无法查看或修改完整密钥。"

msgid "The next time you open this page, state will be pulled from the panel and may overwrite these changes. Please check whether \"Verify panel connection\" in the plugin settings works."
msgstr "下次进入本页面时将从面板拉取状态，可能覆盖本次修改。请检查插件设置中的「验证连接」是否正常。"

msgid "The panel returned an error"
msgstr "面板返回错误"

msgid "The plugin clears the site cache automatically when content or comments change."
msgstr "内容或评论发生变化时，插件会自动清除站点缓存。"

msgid "The plugin is installed and updated automatically by WP Panel; there is no need to download it separately from the WordPress dashboard."
msgstr "插件由 WP Panel 自动安装和更新，无需在 WordPress 后台单独下载。"

msgid "This plugin displays these settings as read-only. They can be changed only in WP Panel, so WordPress administrators cannot weaken server security policies."
msgstr "插件以只读方式显示这些设置；只能在 WP Panel 中修改，避免 WordPress 管理员降低服务器安全策略。"

msgid "The preload queue is empty"
msgstr "预加载队列为空"

msgid "The task runs on WP Panel in the background; you can close this page once it starts."
msgstr "任务由 WP Panel 在后台处理，开始后可以关闭本页面。"

msgid "The value here cannot exceed the PHP memory limit shown above, which comes from the effective configuration in \"Software Management\" in WP Panel."
msgstr "这里的数值不能超过上方显示的 PHP 内存上限；该上限来自 WP Panel“软件管理”的实际生效配置。"

msgid "These pages are cached the first time someone visits them."
msgstr "会在访客第一次打开时正常生成缓存。"

msgid "This feature relies on the PHP %1$sexif%2$s extension to correct photo orientation. Once the panel has installed it, refresh this page to start using it."
msgstr "该功能依赖 PHP %1$sexif%2$s 扩展做拍照方向修正，面板补装完成后刷新本页即可使用。"

msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

msgid "Too many failed attempts. Password verification has been suspended for 10 minutes. Please try again later."
msgstr "验证失败次数过多，已暂停密码验证 10 分钟，请稍后重试。"

msgid "Total saved"
msgstr "累计节省"

msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "方式"

msgid "Unable to read the WP Panel configuration. The site domain or runtime configuration may have changed; rebuild the companion plugin configuration from the site details page in WP Panel."
msgstr "无法读取 WP Panel 配置。网站域名或运行配置可能已变化，请到 WP Panel 网站详情中重建配套插件配置。"

msgid "Unaffected"
msgstr "不受影响"

