msgstr "开启条件"

msgid "WordPress anomaly monitoring"
msgstr "WordPress 异常监控"

msgid "WordPress application passwords"
msgstr "WordPress 应用程序密码"

msgid "WordPress hardening"
msgstr "WordPress 加固"

msgid "WordPress memory limit"
msgstr "WordPress 内存限制"

msgid "WordPress no longer checks for or displays update notices for core, plugins, and themes."
msgstr "WordPress 不再检查或显示核心、插件和主题的更新提醒。"

msgid "Publishing posts, editing pages, and uploading media are unaffected. Protected plugin, theme, code, and site configuration files cannot be changed directly. If an installation, update, or setup task needs to write to these files, use File protection / maintenance in the upper-right corner to unlock the site temporarily with the maintenance password. If temporary maintenance is unavailable, ask the server administrator to handle the task in WP Panel. WP Panel Optimizer is managed by the panel and can still receive its own updates."
msgstr "发布文章、编辑页面和上传媒体不受影响。受保护的插件、主题、代码和站点配置文件不能直接修改。如果安装、更新或配置操作需要写入这些文件，请点击右上角的“文件保护 / 临时维护”，使用维护密码短时解锁。若临时维护不可用，请联系服务器管理员在 WP Panel 中处理。WP Panel Optimizer 由面板托管，文件保护开启时仍可接收自身更新。"

msgid "Writing posts, editing pages, and uploading images are unaffected; installing, updating, or modifying program files is restricted."
msgstr "写文章、编辑页面和上传图片不受影响；安装、更新或修改程序文件会受到限制。"

msgid "XML-RPC interface"
msgstr "XML-RPC 接口"

msgid "minutes"
msgstr "分钟"

